{"id":"n41644-2-10","stage":2,"title":"눈치 · 眼色","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41644-2-10-1","ko":"지수가 왜 이렇게 시무룩하지?","zh":"智秀怎么这么闷闷不乐的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수가","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"시무룩하지?","meaning":"闷闷不乐，不开心","explanation":"시무룩하다：闷闷不乐，不开心；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"시무룩하다","audio":"/audio/31a1d95835f00aee9693.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66293","senseId":"1","lemma":"시무룩하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시무룩하지","audio":"/audio/a3901711230d3b84bfde.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"31a1d95835f00aee","term":"시무룩하다","zh":"闷闷不乐，不开心","audio":"/audio/31a1d95835f00aee9693.mp3","entryId":"66293","definition":"不满意却不说，脸上有不高兴的深情。","pronunciation":["시무루카다"]}],"audio":"/audio/211ec5e6f40d12435af6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n41644-2-10-2","